  "notes": "Item 19 covers 58 of 98 U.S. franchised restaurants open the full 2024 calendar year. Excluded: 31 not open the full 12 months, 147 international locations, theme parks, and 9 that did not report sales/cost data. Four tables extracted: Table 1 (Net Sales by location type), Table 2 (Range of Net Sales \u2014 range buckets only, no average/median, not extracted as individual records since they duplicate Table 1 data in aggregate form), Table 3 (Food Cost % of Net Sales by location type), Table 4 (Labor Cost % of Net Sales by location type). Table 2 range-band records were omitted as they do not add distinct cohort-level averages/medians beyond what Table 1 provides and the schema does not have range-band fields. The FPR is described as not a full P&L \u2014 it omits all operating costs except food, paper, and store-level labor."
